# Webstack design system

Canonical source: [Webstack Design System](https://www.figma.com/design/wBO8pB6A3RmgqTh5JAxrUn) plus [`src/design-system/tokens.json`](src/design-system/tokens.json) and [`src/design-system/text-styles.json`](src/design-system/text-styles.json). CSS variables live in `tokens.css`. The app design file is for layout later — do not invent tokens from it.

## Never

- Raw hex / rgb / `bg-[#…]` / `text-[rgb(…)]`
- Ad-hoc type: `text-2xl font-bold`, `text-[15px]`, random font families
- Arbitrary spacing or radius: `p-[13px]`, `gap-[7px]`, `rounded-[3px]`
- New Relume primitives (`Button`, `Input`, `Dialog`, …) — Relume on existing screens is legacy
- One-off buttons, inputs, badges, or cards
- New CSS values that are not in the catalog

## Always

- **Color:** token classes mapped from Figma (`bg-background-primary-base`, `text-text-secondary`, `border-border-primary`, `bg-webstack-pink`, `bg-primitives-red`)
- **Type:** named utilities from `text-styles.json` (`text-display-xs-semibold`, `text-md-regular`). Display = `--font-display` (Archivo). Body = `--font-body` (Inter).
- **Space:** 4px scale (`p-4` → `--spacing-16`). **Radius:** `rounded-08`, `rounded-full`, etc.
- **Missing token:** add it in Figma first, then `tokens.json` / `tokens.css`. Never invent a value in a component.
- **New UI primitives:** Untitled UI (next pass). Until then, style with tokens only.

```tsx
// BAD
<h1 className="text-2xl font-bold text-[#111]">Title</h1>
<div className="rounded-[10px] p-[13px] bg-[#f7f7f7]" />

// GOOD
<h1 className="text-display-xs-semibold text-text-primary">Title</h1>
<div className="rounded-08 p-4 bg-background-secondary-base" />
```
